<body>
    <h1>Onboarding Profiles</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>The following is a list of available Onboarding profiles by Firm=
 Type.</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Warning" class=3D"confluence-information=
-macro  confluence-information-macro-warning">
 <p class=3D"title conf-macro-render">Reminder</p>
 <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-=
error confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
 <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
  <p><em>A Compass user profile can only be assigned one Onboarding Profile=
.</em></p>
 </div>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"OnboardingProfiles-PMOnboardingProfiles">PM Onboarding Profiles</=
h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <thead>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#f4f5f7 confluenceTd" title=3D"Background color =
: Light grey 100%" data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7">
     <p title=3D""><strong>Onboarding Profile</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#f4f5f7 confluenceTd" title=3D"Background color =
: Light grey 100%" data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7">
     <p title=3D""><strong>Description</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#f4f5f7 confluenceTd" title=3D"Background color =
: Light grey 100%" data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7">
     <p title=3D""><strong>Data Access</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#f4f5f7 confluenceTd" title=3D"Background color =
: Light grey 100%" colspan=3D"1" data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7"><strong =
title=3D"">Role</strong></td>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Assistant</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can create, view, and submit new applications for assigned RR code(=
s)</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>RR code</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_PROCESSOR</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Firm Operations</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can view all applications for firm and sub-branch</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Firm or Sub-branch</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_FIRM_APPROVER</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Portfolio Manager</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can create, view, and submit new applications for assigned RR code(=
s)</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>RR code</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_PROCESSOR</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Firm Submitter</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can create, view, and submit new applications for any RR code at th=
e firm.&nbsp; This profile also enables the use of the Bulk Upload feature.=
</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Firm or Sub-branch</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_FIRM_SUBMITTER</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
