title=3D"">Role</strong></td>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Advisor</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can create, view, and submit new applications for assigned RR code(=
s)</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>RR code</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_PROCESSOR</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Assistant</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can create, view, and submit new applications for assigned RR code(=
s)</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>RR code</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_PROCESSOR</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Branch Manager</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can approve <em>Branch Manager Review</em> workflow stage for any a=
pplication in firm and sub-branch (where applicable)</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Firm or Sub-branch</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_FIRM_APPROVER</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Drop Approver</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can approve <em>Branch Manager Review</em> and <em>Options Review</=
em> stages for any application in firm and sub-branch (where applicable)</p=
>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Firm or Sub-branch</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_FIRM_APPROVER</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>Firm Account Opening</=
strong></td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">Can action stage <em>Account O=
pening =E2=80=93 Manual Data Entry</em> if firm is configured as a self-ope=
ning IB</td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">Firm or Sub-branch</td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_FIRM_APPROVER</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Firm Operations</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can action workflow stages: <em>Initial Review</em>, <em>Final Revi=
ew</em>, <em>Account Opening =E2=80=93 Manual Data Entry </em>(if firm conf=
igured as a self-opening IB), <em>Escalation =E2=80=93 Missing Info Require=
d</em>, <em>Escalation =E2=80=93 Application Declined</em></p>
     <p>Profile to be used when firm operations activities are performed by=
 one user group.</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Firm or Sub-branch</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_FIRM_APPROVER</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Firm Submitter</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can create view, and submit new applications for any RR code at fir=
m. This profile also enables the use of the Bulk Upload feature.</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Firm or Sub- branch</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_FIRM_SUBMITTER</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Reviewer</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can complete <em>Initial Review</em>, <em>Final Review</em>, <em>Es=
calation =E2=80=93 Missing Info Required</em>, <em>Escalation =E2=80=93 App=
lication Declined</em> workflow stages.</p>
     <p>Profile to be used when firm operations activities are performed by=
 different user groups.</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Firm or Sub-branch</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_FIRM_APPROVER</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>ReviewerPostBM</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can complete <em>Final Review</em>, Escalation =E2=80=93 <em>Applic=
ation Declined</em>, <em>Escalation =E2=80=93 More Info Required</em> workf=
low stages</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Firm or Sub-branch</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_FIRM_APPROVER</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>ReviewerPreBM</strong></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Can complete <em>Initial Review</em> workflow stage</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Firm or Sub-branch</p>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">ROLE_FIRM_APPROVER</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p>For further information on IB configurable workflow stages see&nbsp;<a h=
ref=3D"/spaces/CPKB/pages/1091314962/IB+Workflow+Configuration">IB Workflow=
 Configuration</a>.</p>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
